    <string name="privacy_bluetooth">It uses Bluetooth to find nearby devices and read the elliptical data and the heart rate broadcast by the watch. It does not use that data to obtain your location.</string>
    <string name="privacy_health_connect">If you allow it, sessions are also saved to Health Connect on this device. FTMS Lab only writes there; it does not read your health data.</string>
    <string name="privacy_local">FTMS Lab runs entirely on this device. It has no Internet access, creates no accounts and sends no data to any server.</string>
    <string name="privacy_storage">Sessions (time, distance, cadence, power, resistance, calories and heart rate) and the data you enter for heart rate zones and calories are stored only on this device. They leave it only when you export a file and choose which app to share it with. You can delete each session from the history.</string>
